---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Navbar from "../components/ui/Navbar.astro";
---

<!-- TODO: Add Posthog analytics to events -->

<Layout>
    <Navbar />
    <h1>Services</h1>
    <div id="service-hero">
        <p class="services-text">
            I build websites for small-to-medium sized businesses, focusing on
            mobile and desktop compatibility, performance, and making sure each
            client's needs are met. Along with building the website, I also
            handle hosting, maintenance, and updates. Please{" "}
            <a href="mailto:contact@teejmcsteez.tech">contact me</a> for more
            information!
        </p>
    </div>

    <h2 id="portfolio-header">Portfolio</h2>
    <div class="portfolio-item">
        <h2>Salon Website</h2>
        <p>
            The client was tired of constantly answering messages about their
            prices and services, and wanted a place to show their portfolio
            without sending individual pictures. Initially, the client started
            with Acuity Scheduling through its Squarespace integration. However,
            the client did not enjoy setting up the system or how it worked, so
            we decided to remove it and continue with their normal means of
            communication. The website has now been in operation for over a
            year.
        </p>
        <div class="iframe-wrapper">
            <iframe
                class="website-iframe"
                title="Salon Website"
                src="https://www.maryheathermelton.com/"
            ></iframe>
        </div>
        <a class="portfolio-link" href="https://maryheathermelton.com/">
            View Here
        </a>
    </div>
    <div class="portfolio-item">
        <h2>Home Improvement Website</h2>
        <p>
            The client wanted a website to show their portfolio to customers and
            advertise their services, while also improving their presence in
            Google search results for people looking for local home improvement.
            I built and maintain the current website, using Google Analytics and
            Vercel Analytics to improve SEO and reduce the bounce rate.
        </p>
        <div class="iframe-wrapper">
            <iframe
                src="https://meltonshomes.com"
                title="Meltons Home Improvement LLC"
                class="website-iframe"
            ></iframe>
        </div>
        <a href="https://meltonshomes.com" class="portfolio-link">
            View Here
        </a>
    </div>
</Layout>

<style>
    h1 {
        text-align: center;
    }

    #service-hero {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        justify-items: center;
    }

    .services-text {
        margin: 1rem 2rem;
        max-width: 64rem;
    }

    .services-text a {
        text-decoration: underline;
        color: white;
    }

    #portfolio-header {
        align-items: center;
        text-align: center;
    }

    .portfolio-item {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        justify-items: center;
        margin: 1rem;
        padding: 1rem;
    }

    .portfolio-item p {
        max-width: 64rem;
        margin-bottom: 3rem;
    }

    .iframe-wrapper {
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 80rem;
    }

    .website-iframe {
        border: none;
        width: 100%;
        height: 30rem;
    }

    .portfolio-link {
        text-decoration: underline;
        color: white;
    }

    .portfolio-link:hover {
        color: blue;
    }

    @media (prefers-color-scheme: light) {
        .services-text a {
            color: black;
        }

        .portfolio-link {
            color: black;
        }
    }

    .services-text a:hover {
        color: blue;
    }
</style>
